            "detailed_description": "<strong>Gohan Quest</strong> is a humorous adventure RPG that takes place in modern Eastern Europe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Authentic and unique atmosphere of typical russian town.<br>    </li><li>Anime girls VS harsh reality!<br>    </li><li>Gotta find them all!<br>    </li><li>Beat the shit out of criminals, bums, stoners, rabid stray animals, etc.<br>    </li><li>Equip baseball bats, water pistols, soup ladles, laser pointers, fly swatters, valenoks, gas masks, and stuff.<br>    </li><li>Heal with kebabs, kefir, kvass, ice cream and sunflower seeds.<br>    </li><li>Advanced turn-based battle system<br>    </li><li>Non-linear world exploration<br>    </li><li>7-10 hours of gameplay</li></ul><br>Basically, Gohan Quest is a tribute to Earthbound, Undertale and other JRPG classics, but with its own style, plot and humor.",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Gohan Quest</strong> is a humorous adventure RPG that takes place in modern Eastern Europe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Authentic and unique atmosphere of typical russian town.<br>    </li><li>Anime girls VS harsh reality!<br>    </li><li>Gotta find them all!<br>    </li><li>Beat the shit out of criminals, bums, stoners, rabid stray animals, etc.<br>    </li><li>Equip baseball bats, water pistols, soup ladles, laser pointers, fly swatters, valenoks, gas masks, and stuff.<br>    </li><li>Heal with kebabs, kefir, kvass, ice cream and sunflower seeds.<br>    </li><li>Advanced turn-based battle system<br>    </li><li>Non-linear world exploration<br>    </li><li>7-10 hours of gameplay</li></ul><br>Basically, Gohan Quest is a tribute to Earthbound, Undertale and other JRPG classics, but with its own style, plot and humor.",
            "short_description": "Gohan Quest is a humorous adventure RPG that takes place in modern Eastern Europe. Play as anime girls, explore the typical russian town, beat the shit out of gopniks and find the missing &quot;children&quot;! Inspired by golden age JRPGs, from fans to fans.",
